  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Regula Rectionis Adjectivorum, in</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="2">casu Accusativo.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">Adjectiva regunt post se Accusati-</l>
    <l n="4">vos, significantes partem totius alicu-</l>
    <l n="5">jus, aut etiam formam seu qualitatem</l>
    <l n="6">aliquam. ut:</l>
    <l n="7">μέγας πλεύραν βῆς.</l>
    <l n="8">αὐτὴρ μέγας τὰς βηλάς.</l>
    <l n="9">μεγάλοι οἱ Κέλτῃ τὰ σώματα.</l>
    <l n="10">Σύρῳ καὶ τωυόμα, ἡ τῷ πατρίδα.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">
      <i>[Syntaxis hæc, Synecdoche dicta, La-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>tinis figurata; Græcis simplex ac regu-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>laris usu facta videtur. Nisi quis etiam</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>ellipticam esse velit, subaudita Præposi-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>tione ἐς, ante accusativum. ut in illo E-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>pigrammate expresse ponitur:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">ὃς ἐς σῶμα καλὸς, ἐς νῦν δ' αὖ ἐστιν ἄμορφος.</l>
    <l n="18">αὐτὸς ἐς δὴ πλεῖόν μοι ὅχει, ἡ καλός.]</l>
    <l n="19" type="heading" level="1" para="true">DE SYNTAXI PRONO-</l>
    <l n="20" type="heading" level="1">minum.</l>
    <l n="21" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Regula Convenientiæ Interrogativi.</l>
    <l n="22" para="true">Interrogativum &amp; Redditivum casu</l>
    <l n="23">conveniunt: nisi cum per Possessivum</l>
    <l n="24">respondetur. ut:</l>
    <l n="25">O</l>
